### Test QR Transfer Payment APIs

### 1. Create QR Transfer Payment
POST http://localhost:8080/payments/qr-transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 500000,
  "orderInfo": "Thanh toan khoa hoc N5",
  "successRedirectUrl": "http://localhost:3000/payment/success",
  "cancelRedirectUrl": "http://localhost:3000/payment/cancel",
  "bankAccountInfo": "Ngân hàng: Vietcombank\nSố tài khoản: 1234567890\nChủ tài khoản: CÔNG TY ABC"
}

### 2. Get QR Transfer Payment Details
GET http://localhost:8080/payments/qr-transfer/1
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 3. Get Payment Details
GET http://localhost:8080/payments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 4. Get My Payment History
GET http://localhost:8080/payments/my-history?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 5. Admin: Get Payments Waiting Confirmation
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/payments/waiting-confirmation?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 6. Admin: Get Pending Payments
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/payments/pending?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 7. Admin: Process Payment - Approve
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/payments/process
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": 1,
  "action": "approve",
  "adminNotes": "Đã xác nhận chuyển khoản thành công"
}

### 8. Admin: Process Payment - Reject
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/payments/process
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": 1,
  "action": "reject",
  "adminNotes": "Không tìm thấy giao dịch chuyển khoản"
}

### 9. Check Payment Status
GET http://localhost:8080/payments/status/QR_1234567890abcdef
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### Variables for testing:
# @student_token = your_student_jwt_token_here
# @admin_token = your_admin_jwt_token_here 